      "content_html": "<img src=\"https://64.media.tumblr.com/6f436a108cd497d983e4d248d0dfd630/a9174fd406546e59-d9/s640x960/8cd36423f417d21451f04f6fdbc516cf248f2d8c.jpg\" data-orig-height=\"1000\" data-orig-width=\"1500\" alt=\"Title: Labels used on parcels sent from our laboratory &#10;Image: Ten labels with bold black images on yellow&#10;&#10;1. This Side up &#10;2. Handle With care &#10;3. Fragile &#10;4. Heavy and Confusing &#10;5. Unstable Mathematics &#10;6. All Sides up &#10;7. Lightning In a bottle &#10;8. Bigger on the inside&#10;9. Fire stolen from the gods &#10;10. Sentient Package&#10;\" srcset=\"https://64.media.tumblr.com/6f436a108cd497d983e4d248d0dfd630/a9174fd406546e59-d9/s75x75_c1/b7a60919040e956b25bc5acdfc15f51fc974b610.jpg 75w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/6f436a108cd497d983e4d248d0dfd630/a9174fd406546e59-d9/s100x200/16bd533d954ac98ccb69eea79bb8aca3608286b8.jpg 100w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/6f436a108cd497d983e4d248d0dfd630/a9174fd406546e59-d9/s250x400/19e5c9c103ff27d74bc71f9290a9d75aa0581143.jpg 250w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/6f436a108cd497d983e4d248d0dfd630/a9174fd406546e59-d9/s400x600/fc153605e08847c7bb4619163cbbe1d6defbd958.jpg 400w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/6f436a108cd497d983e4d248d0dfd630/a9174fd406546e59-d9/s500x750/b8df6a6c2acd6e2b376ab51f4e631b64344e19d4.jpg 500w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/6f436a108cd497d983e4d248d0dfd630/a9174fd406546e59-d9/s540x810/4e6b04b41036070b307e21bd72e30171633de514.jpg 540w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/6f436a108cd497d983e4d248d0dfd630/a9174fd406546e59-d9/s640x960/8cd36423f417d21451f04f6fdbc516cf248f2d8c.jpg 640w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/6f436a108cd497d983e4d248d0dfd630/a9174fd406546e59-d9/s1280x1920/85df66c110d3d2371ff95b0eadb932a0691a24a5.jpg 1280w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/6f436a108cd497d983e4d248d0dfd630/a9174fd406546e59-d9/s2048x3072/c58a4abeae7ed770ddab4b65ba27eaee139e9743.jpg 1500w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1280px) 100vw, 1280px\"/>"
